@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 # Lifted functions the host replaces (recomp lift --hooks). One hex address per
 # line; the lifted body becomes f_<addr>_orig and the host defines f_<addr>.
+# Disabled for the local dirt3_game.exe (SHA-256 0e1e3a51...): neither address is a
+# function start in that binary, and no generated call site targets them.
 # 01161960  localisation lookup (table, id) -> text, or 0: shims/frontend/menu_patch.cpp
-01161960
